{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近日，黃翠如現身廟街夜市拍攝 Vlog，展開了一趟充滿地道風味的「掃街」美食之旅。當天她以一身白色 V 領上衣搭配同色系長褲亮相，打扮清爽幹練。在行程中，她接連品嚐了咖喱魚蛋、煲仔飯，以及楊枝甘露等經典港式美食，沿途更展現十足親和力，大方與途人及粉絲合照留念。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8b4fb79f-cd0a-434f-bfb9-a6f82381769f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026hyYSN3arkl1786614424.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8b4fb79f-cd0a-434f-bfb9-a6f82381769f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b3ba2ded-be38-4b22-8cd4-52179098259d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20263k7cuRXNA51786614424.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b3ba2ded-be38-4b22-8cd4-52179098259d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">不過，拍攝期間卻發生了一段有趣的小插曲。當黃翠如在鏡頭前舉起手機展示時間時，竟意外讓手機的桌布畫面曝光。不少眼尖的網民迅速發現，她的手機桌布正是丈夫蕭正楠與兒子「蕭哈哈」的溫馨合照。這個不經意的舉動，讓大批網民笑指自己猝不及防地「被放閃」，感受到滿滿的家庭幸福。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"80ab6393-dfaa-4e2c-b7db-d2a6c76fcc4a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026KqmZcKPYbq1786614424.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"80ab6393-dfaa-4e2c-b7db-d2a6c76fcc4a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T02:19:56.008720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":262,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}